<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand light.</p>
<p>Week-to-date 3,500 head confirmed, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed -   None  last week - None   last year -   None</p>
<p>Week-to-date 3,500  last week - 900    last year - 32,100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
